<title>USA: HEI Inc Q4 Aug 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>HEI Inc Q4 Aug 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.32		   $ 0.08</p>
<p> Net			  1,329			314</p>
<p> Revs			 6,397		    5,418</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,172		    3,915</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes $0.07/shr gain due to one-time favorable deferred tax adjustment.  </p>
<p>			 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.52		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			  2,113		    2,040</p>
<p> Revs			20,680		   23,423</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,098		    3,899</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Sale of HEI's FastPoint Light Pen business on August 29, 1996 resulted in a net gain which, combined with the anticipated costs of relocating the remaining activities of HEI's Sauk Centre, Minn. facility, resulted in minimal impact on Q4 performance.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
